- sceneNumber is 1, 2, 3, 4 or 5 and nothing else. Any other number is thrown away by the merge.
- Never return an empty scenes array. If the order genuinely cannot be carried out, return the single scene it was aimed at with its text unchanged and say plainly in changeSummary why you could not do it.
- Never drop a fact, a number, a name or a date that the instruction did not ask you to drop.

