The five scenes are one chain. If you rewrite scene 2 and scene 3 opened by referring to what scene 2 said, then scene 3 is now broken and fixing it is part of the job: rewrite it too and list both numbers in changedScenes. The same applies to the visuals. If you change what the subject is doing at the end of scene 3, the start of scene 4 has to still make sense.
